As rails user:
* cd /home/rails
* mkdir -p apps/brick_city_depot
* chown -R rails:rails /home/rails/apps

* echo "alias bcd='cd /home/rails/apps/brick_city_depot/current'" >> ~/.bashrc
* source ~/.bashrc
* echo "gem: --no-document" > ~/.gemrc

* cd /home/rails/apps/brick_city_depot
* git clone https://github.com/jasonlyles/bcd.git
* mv bcd current

As root user:
* sudo apt update
* sudo apt install git curl libssl-dev libreadline-dev zlib1g-dev autoconf bison build-essential libyaml-dev libreadline-dev libncurses5-dev libffi-dev libgdbm-dev
ADD SOME SWAP MEMORY SO WE CAN BUNDLE INSTALL:
* sudo fallocate -l 1G /swapfile
* sudo chmod 600 /swapfile
* sudo mkswap /swapfile
* sudo swapon /swapfile

As rails user:
* curl -fsSL https://github.com/rbenv/rbenv-installer/raw/HEAD/bin/rbenv-installer | bash
* source ~/.bashrc
* rbenv install 3.3.6
* bcd
* bundle config set without development test
* bundle
* echo "<add production key>" > config/credentials/production.key
* echo "<add production key>" > config/master.key






